  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Word and substantive",
   "texto": [
    "Instead of **efter at undersøgelsen blev afsluttet** (after the study was completed), **efter afslutningen af undersøgelsen** (after the study was completed) is said.",
    "The verbs become substantive with suffix: **afslutte → afslutning** (finish → termination), **undersøge → undersøgelse** (investigate → research)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "What changes",
   "texto": [
    "The noun may be followed by a **af** supplement to indicate which action or theme is spoken of: **afslutningen af undersøgelsen** = the completion of the study.",
    "It is more common in the press and official documents."
   ]
